"""
Nerds Portal v0.10

Local-first portal for Luci OS users:
- creates a Nerds Number in the +153 + 6 digit format
- stores a local device identity, rooms, mini feed, and file-drop queue
- runs an optional self-hosted portal endpoint inside this app
- sends messages directly on LAN or internationally through Nerds Gate

LAN Mode is direct. Internet Mode uses a Nerds Gate relay over WebSocket so
both users can connect outbound from NAT/CGNAT networks.
"""

